// Boss Mat Item
Alias[BOSS_MAT]: %YELLOW%«·»%ORANGE%«·»%YELLOW%«·» %NAME% %YELLOW%«·»%ORANGE%«·»%YELLOW%«·»

// Boss Mat Item Alt
